e’a yelken açıyor!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:29.63,Roger-Monologue,,0,0,0,,Dünya, Büyük Korsan Çağı'na girdi!Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ıDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,vDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,hDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,